---
version: 2.0.2
title: update help
file: ./test/licence_audit/output_snapshot_test.gleam
test_name: update_help_test
---
Review discovered licences and update [tools.licence_audit]. Use --allow or
--deny for non-interactive edits, or --dry-run to preview without writing. With
none of these flags, use the interactive picker.

Command: update

USAGE:
    licence_audit update [ --allow=<SPDX,...> --cache-dir=<DIR>
        --color=<auto|always|never> --config=<PATH> --deny=<SPDX,...> --dry-run
        --manifest=<PATH> --no-cache --quiet --verbose ]

FLAGS:
    --allow=<SPDX,...>           Replace the allow list with comma-separated
                                 SPDX expressions; an empty value clears it,
                                 omission preserves it

    --cache-dir=<DIR>            Use DIR as the application cache root for all
                                 cache families

    --color=<auto|always|never>  Colorize output: auto|always|never (default
                                 auto; alias: --colour)

    --config=<PATH>              Read configuration from PATH

    --deny=<SPDX,...>            Replace the deny list with comma-separated SPDX
                                 expressions; an empty value clears it, omission
                                 preserves it

    --dry-run                    Print discovered licences and the proposed
                                 policy edit without writing; no terminal
                                 required

    --help                       Print help information

    --manifest=<PATH>            Read manifest from PATH

    --no-cache                   Bypass the on-disk caches

    --quiet                      Suppress progress output (alias: -q)

    --verbose                    Show detailed progress output (alias: -v)

